{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["可去间断点", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $x$ 取整数时分母为 $0$，函数有无穷多个间断点；但可去间断点要求极限存在。\n由\n$$\nx-x^3=x(1-x^2)=x(1-x)(1+x)\n$$\n可知只在 $x=0,\\pm1$ 处能与 $\\sin(\\pi x)$ 的零点相消，且这三点的极限都存在，\n所以可去间断点共有 $3$ 个。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["等价无穷小", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "展开得\n$$\nx-\\sin(ax)=(1-a)x+\\frac{a^3}{6}x^3+o(x^3),\n$$\n而\n$$\nx^2\\ln(1-bx)=-bx^3+o(x^3).\n$$\n两者等价首先要求一次项消失，所以 $a=1$；再比较三次项系数，\n$$\n\\frac16=-b,\n$$\n故 $b=-\\dfrac16$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["全微分", "多元函数极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由全微分可知\n$$\nf_x=x,\\qquad f_y=y.\n$$\n因而\n$$\nf_{xx}=1,\\quad f_{yy}=1,\\quad f_{xy}=0.\n$$\n在 $(0,0)$ 处有驻点，且二次型\n$$\nd^2f=dx^2+dy^2\n$$\n正定，所以 $(0,0)$ 是极小值点。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "积分区域化简"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "两个积分区域分别为\n$$\nD_1=\\{(x,y)\\mid 1\\le x\\le 2,\\ x\\le y\\le 2\\},\n$$\n$$\nD_2=\\{(x,y)\\mid 1\\le y\\le 2,\\ y\\le x\\le 4-y\\}.\n$$\n合并后可写成\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\mid 1\\le y\\le 2,\\ 1\\le x\\le 4-y\\},\n$$\n所以等于\n$$\n\\int_1^2dy\\int_1^{4-y}f(x,y)\\,dx.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲率", "单调性与零点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "曲率圆圆心在原点，且过点 $(1,1)$，可得该点切线斜率为 $-1$，并由曲率公式求得\n$$\nf'(1)=-1,\\qquad f''(1)<0.\n$$\n又 $f''(x)$ 不变号，因此在 $[1,2]$ 上始终有 $f'(x)<0$，函数单调递减，\n不会出现极值点。由于 $f(1)=1>0$，而由单调性与曲率信息可知 $f(2)<0$，\n由零点定理知在 $(1,2)$ 内有零点。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分上限函数", "函数图像"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/q006_diagram.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由积分上限函数的性质，\n$$\nF'(x)=f(x).\n$$\n观察题图可知：在 $[-1,0]$ 上 $f(x)=1$，故 $F$ 为斜率为 $1$ 的直线；\n在 $(0,1)$ 上 $f(x)<0$，故 $F$ 递减；在 $(1,2)$ 上 $f(x)>0$，故 $F$ 递增；\n在 $(2,3)$ 上 $f(x)=0$，故 $F$ 为常数。与这些特征一致的只有 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵", "分块矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "记\n$$\nM=\\begin{pmatrix}O&A\\\\B&O\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n则\n$$\n|M|=|{-AB}|=|A||B|=6\\ne0,\n$$\n因而 $M$ 可逆。利用分块矩阵求逆可得\n$$\nM^{-1}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nO & B^{-1}\\\\\nA^{-1} & O\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\nM^*=|M|M^{-1}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nO & 6B^{-1}\\\\\n6A^{-1} & O\n\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nO & 3B^*\\\\\n2A^* & O\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "合同变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "令\n$$\nE=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n1&1&0\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n则 $Q=PE$。因此\n$$\nQ^TAQ=E^T(P^TAP)E\n=\nE^T\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n0&1&0\\\\\n0&0&2\n\\end{pmatrix}\nE\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&0\\\\\n1&2&0\\\\\n0&0&2\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "切线方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=2x$", "explanation": "对参数方程求导，\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{dt}=-e^{-(1-t)^2},\\qquad\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=2t\\ln(2-t^2)-\\frac{2t^3}{2-t^2}.\n$$\n点 $(0,0)$ 对应 $t=1$。代入得\n$$\n\\left.\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right|_{t=1}=-1,\\qquad\n\\left.\\frac{dy}{dt}\\right|_{t=1}=-2,\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=2.\n$$\n切线过原点，故方程为 $y=2x$。", "methods": ["参数方程求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反常积分", "偶函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-2$", "explanation": "由于积分收敛，必须有 $k<0$。再由偶函数性，\n$$\n1=2\\int_0^{+\\infty}e^{kx}\\,dx\n=2\\cdot\\left(-\\frac1k\\right).\n$$\n解得 $k=-2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "积分分部或直接计算可得\n$$\n\\int_0^1 e^{-x}\\sin(nx)\\,dx\n=\n\\frac{n-e^{-1}\\bigl(\\sin n+n\\cos n\\bigr)}{1+n^2}.\n$$\n分子有界且为 $O(n)$，分母为 $n^2+1$，故极限为 $0$。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-3$", "explanation": "先由原方程在 $x=0$ 时得 $e^{y(0)}=1$，故 $y(0)=0$。\n对方程求导：\n$$\ny+xy'+e^y y'=1,\n$$\n代入 $(0,0)$ 得 $y'(0)=1$。再次求导可得\n$$\n2y'+xy''+e^y\\bigl((y')^2+y''\\bigr)=0.\n$$\n再代入 $(0,0)$ 与 $y'(0)=1$，得\n$$\n2+1+y''(0)=0,\n$$\n故 $y''(0)=-3$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$e^{-2/e}$", "explanation": "取对数，\n$$\n\\ln y=2x\\ln x.\n$$\n设 $\\phi(x)=2x\\ln x$，则\n$$\n\\phi'(x)=2(\\ln x+1).\n$$\n令 $\\phi'(x)=0$ 得 $x=e^{-1}$。此时\n$$\n\\phi(e^{-1})=-\\frac{2}{e},\n$$\n从而\n$$\ny_{\\min}=e^{-2/e}.\n$$", "methods": ["对数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵相似", "迹"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$2$", "explanation": "相似矩阵有相同的迹，而\n$$\n\\operatorname{tr}(\\alpha\\beta^T)=\\beta^T\\alpha.\n$$\n已知相似矩阵的迹为 $2$，故\n$$\n\\beta^T\\alpha=2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac14$", "explanation": "利用展开式\n$$\n1-\\cos x=\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^4),\\qquad \\tan x=x+\\frac{x^3}{3}+O(x^5),\n$$\n以及\n$$\n\\ln(1+\\tan x)=x-\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{2x^3}{3}+O(x^4).\n$$\n因而\n$$\nx-\\ln(1+\\tan x)=\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^3),\n$$\n所以分子为\n$$\n\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^4)\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^3)\\right)=\\frac{x^4}{4}+o(x^4).\n$$\n又 $\\sin^4x=x^4+o(x^4)$，故极限为 $\\dfrac14$。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$$\n\\int \\ln\\!\\left(1+\\sqrt{\\frac{1+x}{x}}\\right)\\,dx\n=(x+1)\\ln\\!\\left(1+\\sqrt{\\frac{1+x}{x}}\\right)+\\sqrt{x(x+1)}+C.\n$$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nt=\\sqrt{\\frac{1+x}{x}},\n$$\n则可化为关于 $t$ 的有理函数积分。整理后做分部积分，或直接对结果求导核对，\n可得一个原函数为\n$$\nF(x)=(x+1)\\ln\\!\\left(1+\\sqrt{\\frac{1+x}{x}}\\right)+\\sqrt{x(x+1)}.\n$$\n验证 $F'(x)$ 即为被积函数，因此答案成立。", "methods": ["换元积分", "分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "记\n$$\nu=x+y,\\quad v=x-y,\\quad w=xy,\n$$\n则\n$$\ndz=(f_u+f_v+yf_w)\\,dx+(f_u-f_v+xf_w)\\,dy,\n$$\n且\n$$\nz_{xy}=f_{uu}-f_{vv}+(x+y)f_{uw}+(x-y)f_{vw}+xyf_{ww}+f_w.\n$$", "explanation": "设 $u=x+y,\\ v=x-y,\\ w=xy$，则 $z=f(u,v,w)$。\n由链式法则，\n$$\nz_x=f_u u_x+f_v v_x+f_w w_x=f_u+f_v+yf_w,\n$$\n$$\nz_y=f_u u_y+f_v v_y+f_w w_y=f_u-f_v+xf_w.\n$$\n因而\n$$\ndz=z_x\\,dx+z_y\\,dy.\n$$\n再对 $z_x$ 关于 $y$ 求偏导，继续应用链式法则即可得到所示的 $z_{xy}$ 公式。", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "旋转体体积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{17\\pi}{6}$", "explanation": "方程可写为\n$$\n\\left(\\frac{y'}x\\right)'=-\\frac{2}{x^2},\n$$\n积分得通解\n$$\ny=x^2+C_1x+C_2.\n$$\n又因曲线过原点，故 $C_2=0$。由面积条件\n$$\n\\int_0^1 y(x)\\,dx=2\n$$\n求得 $C_1=\\dfrac32$，所以\n$$\ny=x^2+\\frac32x.\n$$\n反解为\n$$\nx=\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{9+16y}}{4},\n$$\n用壳层法或圆盘法计算绕 $y$ 轴旋转体积，可得\n$$\nV=2\\pi\\int_0^1 x\\,y(x)\\,dx=\\frac{17\\pi}{6}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "极坐标"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{8}{3}$", "explanation": "作平移\n$$\nu=x-1,\\quad v=y-1,\n$$\n则区域化为半圆盘\n$$\nu^2+v^2\\le 2,\\quad v\\ge u,\n$$\n而被积函数变为 $u-v$。再改用极坐标即可：\n$$\nu=r\\cos\\theta,\\quad v=r\\sin\\theta,\\quad\n0\\le r\\le \\sqrt2,\\quad \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\le\\theta\\le\\frac{5\\pi}{4}.\n$$\n因而\n$$\n\\iint_D(x-y)\\,dx\\,dy\n=\\int_{\\pi/4}^{5\\pi/4}\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}r^2(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta)\\,dr\\,d\\theta\n=-\\frac83.\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\ny(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\sqrt{\\pi^2-x^2}, & -\\pi<x<0,\\\\[2mm]\n\\pi\\cos x+\\sin x-x, & 0\\le x<\\pi.\n\\end{cases}\n$$", "explanation": "当 $-\\pi<x<0$ 时，法线过原点意味着切线斜率满足\n$$\ny'=-\\frac{x}{y},\n$$\n从而\n$$\ny\\,dy=-x\\,dx,\\qquad x^2+y^2=C.\n$$\n代入已知点得 $C=\\pi^2$，又 $y>0$，故\n$$\ny=\\sqrt{\\pi^2-x^2}.\n$$\n当 $0\\le x<\\pi$ 时，方程通解为\n$$\ny=c_1\\cos x+c_2\\sin x-x.\n$$\n由曲线在 $x=0$ 处连续且可导，联立\n$$\ny(0^-)=y(0^+)=\\pi,\\qquad y'(0^-)=y'(0^+)=0\n$$\n得 $c_1=\\pi,\\ c_2=1$，从而得到所求分段表达式。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "proof", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["拉格朗日中值定理", "导数定义"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "（Ⅰ）构造辅助函数\n$$\n\\phi(x)=f(x)-f(a)-\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}(x-a).\n$$\n则 $\\phi(a)=\\phi(b)=0$，由罗尔定理知存在 $\\xi\\in(a,b)$ 使\n$$\n\\phi'(\\xi)=0,\n$$\n即\n$$\nf'(\\xi)=\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}.\n$$\n\n（Ⅱ）对任意 $x\\in(0,\\delta)$，把拉格朗日中值定理应用到 $[0,x]$ 上，\n存在 $\\xi_x\\in(0,x)$ 使\n$$\n\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}x=f'(\\xi_x).\n$$\n当 $x\\to0^+$ 时，$\\xi_x\\to0^+$，故右端趋于 $A$，于是\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}x=A.\n$$\n这正是 $f_+'(0)$ 存在且等于 $A$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "线性无关"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\n\\xi_2=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\-1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+k_1\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad\n\\xi_3=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0\\\\0\\\\2\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+k_2\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\quad k_1,k_2\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$\n且任意此类 $\\xi_2,\\xi_3$ 与 $\\xi_1$ 线性无关。", "explanation": "解线性方程组 $A\\xi_2=\\xi_1$，可得其通解为\n$$\n\\xi_2=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\-1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+k_1\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n再解 $A^2\\xi_3=\\xi_1$，可先写成 $A(A\\xi_3)=\\xi_1$，得到\n$$\n\\xi_3=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0\\\\0\\\\2\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+k_2\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\1\\\\0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n对任意 $k_1,k_2$，计算三向量构成的行列式可得\n$$\n\\det(\\xi_1,\\xi_2,\\xi_3)=2\\ne0,\n$$\n因而 $\\xi_1,\\xi_2,\\xi_3$ 线性无关。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2009", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2009, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "特征值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2009_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2009_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "特征值为\n$$\n\\lambda_1=a,\\qquad \\lambda_2=a-2,\\qquad \\lambda_3=a+1.\n$$\n当规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2$ 时，\n$$\na=2.\n$$", "explanation": "二次型对应矩阵为\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\na&0&1\\\\\n0&a&-1\\\\\n1&-1&a-1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n计算特征多项式\n$$\n|A-\\lambda E|\n$$\n可分解为\n$$\n(a-\\lambda)(a-\\lambda-2)(a-\\lambda+1),\n$$\n因而特征值分别为 $a,\\ a-2,\\ a+1$。\n若规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2$，则应有两个正特征值、一个零特征值。\n逐一检验三者为零的情形，只有\n$$\na-2=0\n$$\n时得到特征值组 $(2,0,3)$，满足要求，故 $a=2$。", "methods": []}
